  "description": "Ranju has had a massive crush on Jiha, the school’s most popular girl, with her angelic beauty and kind nature. But when Ranju hears the shocking news that Jiha is going on a group date, she’s thrown into a panic. Determined not to let her chance slip away, Ranju hatches a bold plan to win Jiha’s heart before anyone else can. Will Ranju’s daring moves lead to the romance of her dreams, or will she get stopped on her way to the finish line?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
